   "subject": "what's legend group 0 mean",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Hope this email finds you well! </div><div><br></div><div>I am trying to use different colors to represent different species in a tree, in some of the trees I created(not all trees), I found a legend group named 0, I am pretty sure that there is no species&#39; name called &quot;0&quot; in my case, and I find the same issue also appeared in an example on your &quot;Tree Manipulation&quot; web page.   </div><div><br></div><div>May I ask where the group 0 coming from and what is the meaning of the corresponding tree branch that being marked by the color of group 0? </div><div><br></div><div>Thank you so much for your help!</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Man </div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3idfLmOt_Bo/WmDowts3D1I/AAAAAAAAAAM/706RTUS5ztswh1PL1M7Hpb4tYCZUKqp7gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2018-01-18%2Bat%2B1.32.59%2BPM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3idfLmOt_Bo/WmDowts3D1I/AAAAAAAAAAM/706RTUS5ztswh1PL1M7Hpb4tYCZUKqp7gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2018-01-18%252Bat%252B1.32.59%252BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482615758000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YHvRc8sdEr_AQM4k3wYGD\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3idfLmOt_Bo/WmDowts3D1I/AAAAAAAAAAM/706RTUS5ztswh1PL1M7Hpb4tYCZUKqp7gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2018-01-18%2Bat%2B1.32.59%2BPM.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "Wb2t5A32AgAJ",
   "from": "Yu, Guangchuang",
   "author": "cec41188340e8212",
   "date": "2018-01-19T03:14:04Z",
   "subject": "Re: what's legend group 0 mean",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">The group 0 is reserved for any branches that are not belonging to any groups. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">For legend, you can rename it or disable it.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Try :</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\">ggtree(tree, aes(color=group)) + geom_tiplab() +\r\n     scale_color_manual(values=c(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;black&#39;</span>, rainbow_hcl(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">4</span>)), breaks=names(cls)) + theme(legend.position=<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;right&quot;</span>)\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">It will display the legend without ‘group 0’.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj5UaGUgZ3JvdXAgMCBpcyByZXNlcnZlZCBmb3IgYW55IGJyYW5jaGVzIHRoYXQgYXJlIG5v\r\ndCBiZWxvbmdpbmcgdG8gYW55IGdyb3Vwcy4gPGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+\r\nRm9yIGxlZ2VuZCwgeW91IGNhbiByZW5hbWUgaXQgb3IgZGlzYWJsZSBpdC48L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxi\r\ncj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PlRyeSA6PC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5gYGByPGJyPjwvZGl2\r\nPjxkaXY+Z2d0cmVlKHRyZWUsIGFlcyhjb2xvcj1ncm91cCkpICsgZ2VvbV90aXBsYWIoKSArPGJy\r\nPiZuYnNwOyZuYnNwOyZuYnNwOyZuYnNwOyBzY2FsZV9jb2xvcl9tYW51YWwodmFsdWVzPWMoJ2Js\r\nYWNrJywgcmFpbmJvd19oY2woNCkpLCBicmVha3M9bmFtZXMoY2xzKSkgKyB0aGVtZShsZWdlbmQu\r\ncG9zaXRpb249InJpZ2h0Iik8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PmBgYDwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+\r\nSXQgd2lsbCBkaXNwbGF5IHRoZSBsZWdlbmQgd2l0aG91dCAnZ3JvdXAgMCcuPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48\r\nYnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
