     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Hope this email finds you well! </div><div><br></div><div>I am trying to use different colors to represent different species in a tree, in some of the trees I created(not all trees), I found a legend group named 0, I am pretty sure that there is no species&#39; name called &quot;0&quot; in my case, and I find the same issue also appeared in an example on your &quot;Tree Manipulation&quot; web page.   </div><div><br></div><div>May I ask where the group 0 coming from and what is the meaning of the corresponding tree branch that being marked by the color of group 0? </div><div><br></div><div>Thank you so much for your help!</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Man </div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3idfLmOt_Bo/WmDowts3D1I/AAAAAAAAAAM/706RTUS5ztswh1PL1M7Hpb4tYCZUKqp7gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2018-01-18%2Bat%2B1.32.59%2BPM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3idfLmOt_Bo/WmDowts3D1I/AAAAAAAAAAM/706RTUS5ztswh1PL1M7Hpb4tYCZUKqp7gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2018-01-18%252Bat%252B1.32.59%252BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482615762000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3vePO2ApI1tCHWgaR2TYN9\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3idfLmOt_Bo/WmDowts3D1I/AAAAAAAAAAM/706RTUS5ztswh1PL1M7Hpb4tYCZUKqp7gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2018-01-18%2Bat%2B1.32.59%2BPM.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
